n class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"3\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\" style=\"transform: scale(1, 1.34928);\">√</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\" mathquill-block-id=\"5\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"4\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"6\">6</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"8\">x</var><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"10\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"12\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"11\">1</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"13\">2</span></span></span><span mathquill-command-id=\"16\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">+</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"18\">1</span></span></span></span></div></div>    </td>   \n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"14\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic sine function is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"15\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=