hML\"><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n\n</td></tr>\n<tr height=\"40px\">\n<td width=\"30\" height=\"10\" style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: top; border:1px solid black; border-right:hidden; border-bottom:hidden; border-left:hidden\">    <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"-1\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"79\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>    </td>\n<td width=\"30\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size: 0.9em; border-bottom:hidden; vertical-align: top; position: relative;\">\n</td>\n<td width=\"110\" height=\"10\" style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: top; border:1px solid black; border-right:hidden; border-left:hidden; border-bottom:hidden\"><div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:120px;\n                                        margin-left:6px;\n                                        margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"91\"><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"93\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-sqrt-prefix\" style=\"transform: scale(1, 1.34928);\">√</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf mq-sqrt-stem\" mathquill-block-id=\"95\"><var mathquill-command-id=\"94\">e</var><span class=\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\" mathquill-command-id=\"96\"><span class=\"mq-sup\" mathquill-block-id=\"98\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"97\">2</span><var mathquill-command-id=\"99\">x</var></span></span><span mathquill-command-id=\"102\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">+</span><span mathquill-command-id=\"104\">1</span></span></span></span></div></div>    </td>   \n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"80\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The formula for the derivative of the inverse hyperbolic sine function is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"81\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx